# Band boundaries: Netherlands day-period convention (Unicode CLDR nl); West
# Frisian is co-official in Fryslan and shares it. CLDR ships no fy day-period
# rules. Surfaces: Frysk Wurdboek (Fryske Akademy, gtb.ivdnt.org).
# 'moarns' = 's morgens / in the morning; the morning band is [06:00, 12:00).
# NOTE: the bare noun 'moarn' is NOT listed -- it means "tomorrow" (named_day_1),
# so only the adverbial 'moarns' names the daypart.
moarns
